      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const rows = $input.all();\n\nlet formatted = 'Legacy Farms — Weekly Sales KPI Data\\n\\n';\n\nfor (const row of rows) {\n  const r = row.json;\n  formatted += `${r['Week']}:\\n`;\n  formatted += `  Outgrowers Onboarded: ${r['Outgrowers Onboarded']}\\n`;\n  formatted += `  RCN Sold: ${r['RCN Sold (kg)']} kg\\n`;\n  formatted += `  Revenue: NGN ${r['Revenue (NGN)']}\\n`;\n  formatted += `  Leads Generated: ${r['Leads Generated']}\\n`;\n  formatted += `  Outstanding Debtors: NGN ${r['Outstanding Debtors (NGN)']}\\n\\n`;\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { kpiData: formatted } }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        416,
        0
      ],
      "id": "d517e5fe-0414-4403-a65c-f041819426a1",
      "name": "Code in JavaScript"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json['kpiData'] }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an operations analyst for Legacy Farms in Nigeria.\n\nYou will receive weekly KPI data. Use the Calculator tool to compute exact percentage changes between weeks before drawing conclusions.\n\nReturn your response as clean HTML only — no markdown, no backticks, no explanation. Just the HTML. Do not include <html>, <head>, or <body> tags — start directly from the content.\n\nUse this structure and styling:\n\n1. Header div: background #1A5276, padding 30px, centered white text \"Legacy Farms\" in 13px uppercase with letter spacing, below it \"Weekly Ops Digest\" in bold 24px white\n\n2. Content div: padding 30px, font Arial, color #333333\n\nStructure the content exactly like this:\n\n<h2 style=\"color: #1A5276;\">Executive Summary</h2>\n2 sentences summarising overall performance trend.\n\n<h2 style=\"color: #27AE60;\">What's On Track</h2>\nBullet points of metrics performing well with specific numbers and % change.\n\n<h2 style=\"color: #E67E22;\">What Needs Attention</h2>\nBullet points of metrics that dropped with exact % change from Calculator.\n\n<h2 style=\"color: #1A5276;\">Priority Actions</h2>\n3 numbered specific actionable recommendations.\n\n3. Footer div: centered, color #999999, font-size 12px — \"Legacy Farms · Ogbomoso, Oyo State, Nigeria\"\n\nBe direct. Use real numbers. No generic advice."
        }
      },
